{"ref":"BDB, אוֹנוֹ","hw":"אוֹנוֹ","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹנוֹ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong><em>vigorous</em>, for <span dir=\"rtl\">אונון</span><strong>)</strong> city in Benjamin <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:33\" href=\"/Ezra.2.33\">Ezr 2:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:36\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.36\">Ne 7:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:35\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.35\">11:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.12\">1 Ch 8:12</a>; valley of same name <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.2\">Ne 6:2</a>; prob. <em>Kefr ʿAnâ</em>, NW. of Lydda, Survey<sup>II, 251</sup>.","next":"BDB, אוֹנָם","prev":"BDB, אוֹן²"}